The catalogue title is retained as metadata. Named certificates, contracts, bounds or frameworks in that title are not asserted as results of the original source extract.
Source-record limitation: This is a broad deep-learning research agenda without a specified regression class, PDE, sampling model, error criterion, or dimensional dependence. There is no determinate mathematical target to preserve.
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
What error bounds can be obtained for regression of high-dimensional nonsmooth functions, how can PDEs be solved without the curse of dimensionality, and what training and validation data sizes and distributions are efficient and effective for deep learning? \href{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2021/23}{[S2]}
